{
  "answer": "Based on the current documented offers, the best promotional bonus depends on whether you need a personal or business card.",
  "personal_card": {
    "card": "EcoCard",
    "offer": "Earn 2,000 sustainability points—worth $20 when redeemed as a statement credit or checking-account credit—after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases within the first month.",
    "offer_window": "August 1, 2025 through December 15, 2025",
    "annual_fee": "$50",
    "important_note": "This requires substantially more spending than the bonus value, so it may not be worthwhile unless the spending fits your normal budget."
  },
  "business_card": {
    "card": "Business Bronze Rewards Card",
    "offer": "Earn a $500 statement credit after making $10,000 in net new purchases within the first two months.",
    "offer_window": "October 1, 2025 through March 31, 2026",
    "annual_fee": "$0"
  },
  "comparison": "The Business Bronze offer is the largest documented sign-up bonus by dollar value. For personal cards, I found no currently active points or cash-back sign-up bonus larger than the EcoCard offer. A previously advertised $500 Silver Rewards Card bonus required opening the account by June 30, 2025, so that offer is no longer active.",
  "recommendation": "If this is for personal use, consider the EcoCard only if you can naturally meet the $5,000 first-month spending requirement and value its sustainability rewards. If this is for a business, the Business Bronze Rewards Card has the strongest documented sign-up bonus."
}
